                "senses": [
                    {
                        "sense_id": "0fc59fa7-aeb2-34ca-98b5-5fb9fb5def62",
                        "entry_id": "0babbd95-c8bc-38f0-b7ab-44a173c9fb0f",
                        "glosses": [
                            "parasitism (about people)"
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "5555585d-191b-4aec-b0a4-d3c530d1e03d",
                                "sense_id": "0fc59fa7-aeb2-34ca-98b5-5fb9fb5def62",
                                "text": "Е́сли тунея́дство существу́ет, то предполага́ется само́ собо́ю, что ря́дом с ним существу́ет и трудолю́бие — на э́том зи́ждется вся нау́ка полити́ческой эконо́мии.",
                                "translation": "If parasitism exists, then it is a natural corollary that industry exists side by side with it – on this the whole science of political economy is founded.",
                                "english": "If parasitism exists, then it is a natural corollary that industry exists side by side with it – on this the whole science of political economy is founded."
                            }
                        ]
                    }
                ],
